CompatibleARCclient -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 1: Open authenticated raw loopback TCP; one length-prefixed request\n<size:14>[arc-protobuf-v1 loopback TCP]</size>
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ClientAuthenticator <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 2: Authenticate envelope with expected_kind=arc; validate version/method before target access
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 3: Admit authenticated principal and exact reserved ARC method identity
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ComposemanagementUI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 4: Access only selected unprotected root after admission
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine -> CompatibleARCclient <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 5: Unary result OR repeated watch responses with same ID/version; bounded payload
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine -> CompatibleARCclient <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 6: Normal-completion branch: terminal end_of_stream=true then close
CompatibleARCclient -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 7: Alternative before normal completion: cancel by closing watch socket; Cancel8 unsupported\n<size:14>[arc-protobuf-v1 loopback TCP]</size>
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ArcEngine -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AuditLogger <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 8: Close per-request streams; input lease spans unary sockets; record sanitized outcome

